<!-- Clan Gun Truck, assembled: gun_truck/hull plus gun_truck/turret on its ring mount at (-62, 112, 0). Length 300 cm on X, origin at the chassis centre on the ground, nose and gun face +X. Sprites render hull and turret as separate layers (art/sprites.py). -->
